Package: PastMoments
Type: Package
Title: Reconstruct Empirical Moments of Traits Through Phylogenetic
        Time
Version: 0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person(
        given = "Gilles",
        family = "Didier",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        email = "gilles.didier@free.fr"
    )
    )
Description: Reconstructs the conditional empirical mean, empirical variance,
    and expected empirical standard deviation of continuous traits through
    time on rooted phylogenetic trees.
    Brownian models are supported, together with clade-specific
    reconstructions, analytic moments, optional quantiles
    of Gaussian quadratic forms, exact unconditional Brownian
    empirical-variance comparisons, and graphical summaries.
